/*
   american fuzzy lop - LLVM-mode wrapper for clang
   ------------------------------------------------

   Written by Laszlo Szekeres <lszekeres@google.com> and
              Michal Zalewski <lcamtuf@google.com>

   LLVM integration design comes from Laszlo Szekeres.

